    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Tap the item",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the item on the map, here <strong>Rally point</strong>. Then tap the share sign in its radial menu, an arrow out of a box.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1977927b997f2e7b.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick Chat…",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In <strong>Send: Rally point</strong>, tap <strong>Chat…, ODMatrix</strong>. Rows in grey cannot be used now, and each says why.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/23914e9d7b62553a.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick the chat",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the chat it should go to, here <strong>1st Platoon</strong>. Your chats are listed by name.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b7d83efe323dceeb.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check the map",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>On the map the item now reads <strong>Shared</strong>. It went to the chat only, not to a feed.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/ed6c6b02d6e80e97.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Sent",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Chat</strong> and open 1st Platoon to see it as a <strong>MAP ITEM</strong> with its position. <strong>Show on map</strong> takes you back to it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9966a2505a52daa2.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
